// The window's tree's bindings run by the frame that takes each change of the workspace of real size, on each screen
// that holds the topic it reaches (real_size_wbtest.mbt), by window, screen, way of asking and cause: a row only where
// it runs any; a row not here is held to none. Each the bar it may only fall from (the test's head says the rule and its
// floor; the lines to write are printed by the test). Counted 2026-11-16 (on main after #6556) on the values and changes of
// client/core-ts/test/real-size.ts.

// Written again 2026-11-20: the wide chat's page made as nodes by default (chatPage on the test channel): the bindings
// its rows run as a change comes counted where the old view's were not (chat/thing, screen, message; the list's live
// step, its outline's edit), those no longer run taken out.

// Raised once, 2026-11-17: 小屏 Home's list no longer opens under what is left up long (moved into 待处理, sfdesk
// open_jobs.mbt): a change of the chats' list (chats/down, card, archived) runs the bindings of the rows of a screen more
// of chats shown in their place; what is left up long changing (longJobs/job) runs none on Home.

// Added 2026-11-20: an account's trouble giving a link to open (fixture_open.mbt settings-profile-verify: Google asking
// an Antigravity CLI account to be verified), a new screen holding the profile and its station as 额度查询失败's does, at
// its bar.

// Added 2026-11-17: the screens of safe mode after its upgrade (fixture_open.mbt: lock-out-security, settings-vault-
// syncing and -confirm, settings-lock-prompt-role, settings-security-again, -root-off, -root and -confirm), new screens
// each holding the profiles' list as the settings' pages beside them do, at their bar.

// Added 2026-11-17: the remote screen's page made as nodes (sfpages screen_*.mbt): a change of its view's tabs
// (screens/screen) runs its tabs' row, and a sample of its station's link (stationNet) the bar's link chip, where its old
// view's were not counted.

// Raised once, 2026-11-16: the board's cards say their chat as Home's list's rows do (sfpages board_node.mbt: the list's
// marks on its title's line, who is in it by row_aside_node), each part told only as what it shows of the chat's row
// changes: a station's going down runs what of them shows it (its mark on the title's line, its ink).

// Added 2026-11-16: the settings' sidebar beside every settings page in a wide window made once as nodes
// (settings_side_node), each row held by its own computed (settings_list.mbt settings_side_row_node): a change of the
// accounts (profiles/down) runs the bindings of 账号's row (Profile, its count) alone, 6, where they ran 82 as the old
// view's sidebar was not counted; 账号's page in reading's words, the rows of its card a change reaches, 1 each.

// Raised 2026-11-21: 概览's 需处理 rows say each account's tier after its name (profiles_overview.mbt ov_alert_block,
// #7908), newly shown: profiles/down mounts those rows with their tags (104 to 117).

// Raised once, 2026-11-17: the wide profiles' place's sidebar made as nodes (sfdesk places_side_node.mbt): the rows of the
// accounts gone down that it shows tell their state, their red line, their allowance and 概览's 需处理 there, 30 more
// (186), where its old view's were not counted.

// Raised once, 2026-11-16: the chat's sheets made as nodes (sheets.mbt): what their old bodies built again as a change
// came now its bindings, each told only as what it reads changes (an agent, a job, what the chat holds: computeds).
// Added 2026-11-16: wide place-profiles opens on 概览 (sfpages profiles_overview.mbt): a quota change runs its two
// charts' shapes bindings (2), and profiles/down mounts the broken accounts' 需处理 rows (224).
// Brought down 2026-11-16: a station's page reads its station narrowed to what each part shows (sfpages
// station_node.mbt's station_narrowed), a dial its own (sf quota_node.mbt): a change of the station none of the page
// shows runs none of it (83 phone, 90 wide, now 0), its machine's first meter only that dial (90 to 13); 概览 works
// out what it lists once (profiles_overview.mbt): a quota leaving its pools as they were runs none (2 to 0), accounts
// going down the 需处理 rows they bring (224 to 156). Held by page_fanout_wbtest.mbt.
// Brought down 2026-11-16: 全部密钥's blocks each hold their piece and row by key, a row its vault's id and name alone
// (vault.mbt vault_all_block): a secret used and the vault's own row changed run none (89-91 to 0), a secret added what
// it brings (96 to 5 phone, 19 wide); 连接's rows read their place by key and each field by its own computed
// (connects.mbt connects_placed, cn_row_node): a session more runs none (92-96 wide, 39 phone, to 0); 更新日志's
// heading keeps its words, its tabs, head and blocks computeds (80/78 to 49/48); 自动补全's rows read the rule
// narrowed (84 to 76 phone, of them 73 the stations' sections the list's window brings as the 检查 row goes; its
// policy pages 8 to 0). Held by page_fanout_wbtest.mbt.
// Written again, 2026-11-16: the stations' and the profiles' lists and an account's page made once as nodes on every
// screen (sfpages stations_list.mbt, profiles_list.mbt): what their old views built is made now, counted as the tree's.
// Added 2026-11-16: 已归档 made once as nodes (sfpages archive_node.mbt; the wide sidebar's lane, sfdesk
// archive_side_node.mbt), each block held by its own computed: a change of the archive runs those of the blocks it
// reaches and the rows that come or go, where the old view built the list again uncounted; each row's keys mbui's
